[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0476","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0476.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12087","title":"Rsync rsync 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Rsync 在处理 `--inc-recursive` 增量递归选项时存在路径遍历漏洞。该选项在客户端默认启用，且服务端可在未获客户端明确授权的情况下强制启用。由于对符号链接（symlink）的验证不充分，结合基于文件列表的去重检查机制，恶意 rsync 服务端可将文件写入客户端预期目标目录之外的任意位置，实现路径遍历攻击。攻击者可通过构造特制文件列表，将恶意文件写入受害者系统中以合法目录命名的任意路径，严重威胁系统完整性与数据安全。该漏洞影响 Rsync 全版本用户，CWE-22 分类，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12087"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:25.467","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:48.573","remediation":"升级 rsync 至 3.4.0 及以上版本（上游于 2025 年 1 月 14 日发布修复）；RHEL/CentOS 用户安装 RHSA-2025:2600 等对应安全更新；Debian 用户参照 DLA-2025-01 公告更新。临时缓解措施：在客户端使用 `--no-inc-recursive` 禁用增量递归模式，并避免使用 `-l`/`-a` 参数连接不可信的 rsync 服务端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2025:6470","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23154","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23235","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23407","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23415","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23416","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23842","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23853","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23854","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23858","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2600","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:7050","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8385","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-12087","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2330672","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00008.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250131-0002/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://github.com/google/security-research/security/advisories/GHSA-p5pg-x43v-mvqj","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12087.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12087.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12087.json","https://github.com/RsyncProject/rsync/blob/3b84610ccb35d1355f6e88e0e870bef48a164fbb/NEWS.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-12087","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/r/rsync/rsync.spec","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/e804374278d178cbcb1dcf921b09ff120cb635c2/main/rsync/APKBUILD","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5462df1242ecdfa07cb8ddac80e6ca8fcb2b6836/2024/CVE-2024-12087.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12087.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-12087.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0476.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0475","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0475.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12086","title":"Rsync 服务器端泄露客户端任意文件漏洞","description":"Rsync 文件同步工具中存在客户端文件信息泄露漏洞（CWE-390），攻击者可通过搭建恶意 rsync 服务器诱导客户端连接。在文件从客户端向服务端传输过程中，服务端会发送本地文件的校验和供客户端比对以确定需传输的数据。恶意服务端通过发送针对任意文件的特制校验和值，基于客户端的响应逐字节重建客户端文件内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响所有使用 rsync 进行文件传输的场景，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12086"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:25.297","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:48.400","remediation":"立即将 rsync 升级至 3.4.0 或更高版本。RHEL 用户安装 RHSA-2026:19368/RHSA-2026:20603 等安全更新；Debian 用户参照 DLA-2025-008 更新至修复版本。如无法升级，避免使用 rsync 从不可信服务器拉取文件，或使用 --dry-run 预览文件操作后再执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2025:6470","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19368","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20603","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:29197","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-12086","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2330577","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00008.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250131-0002/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://github.com/google/security-research/security/advisories/GHSA-p5pg-x43v-mvqj","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12086.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12086.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12086.json","https://github.com/RsyncProject/rsync/blob/3b84610ccb35d1355f6e88e0e870bef48a164fbb/NEWS.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-12086","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/r/rsync/rsync.spec","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12086.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/d835502983c744c84cf033713a5978c1178bffab/main/rsync/APKBUILD","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5462df1242ecdfa07cb8ddac80e6ca8fcb2b6836/2024/CVE-2024-12086.md","https://github.com/truenas/ports/blob/9461a3499b989bc1cd4410a2fb9f96bd3fc53bea/net/rsync/Makefile"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0475.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0474","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0474.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12085","title":"Rsync 未初始化堆栈内容信息泄露漏洞","description":"Rsync 文件同步工具在比较文件校验和时存在未初始化内存信息泄露漏洞。攻击者可通过操控校验和长度（s2length）参数，使程序将校验和与未初始化的栈内存进行比较，从而逐字节泄露栈中的敏感数据。该漏洞影响所有使用 rsync 进行文件校验的场景，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞获取目标系统的栈内存信息，可能导致进一步的信息收集攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12085"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:25.123","updated":"2026-07-20T11:16:33.323","remediation":"立即将 rsync 升级至 3.4.0 或更高版本（上游已发布修复，可从 https://github.com/RsyncProject/rsync 获取）。各发行版用户安装对应安全更新：RHEL/CentOS 执行 `yum update rsync` 安装 RHSA-2025:0324 等补丁，Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt update && apt upgrade rsync`。如无法立即升级，可在 rsync 服务器配置中限制 `--checksum` 选项的使用，或通过防火墙限制仅受信任 IP 访问 rsync 服务端口（默认 873）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2025:6470","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0324","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0325","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0637","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0688","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0714","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0774","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0787","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0790","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0849","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0884","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0885","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1120","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1123","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1128","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1225","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1227","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1242","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1451","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:21885","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2701","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-12085","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2330539","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00008.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250131-0002/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://github.com/google/security-research/security/advisories/GHSA-p5pg-x43v-mvqj","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12085.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e28e8e8f0aba9e30b308efdfe0fc8edb9994cc08/2024/CVE-2024-12085.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/aaad87cd4808a501b9c27168b0278466591227b9/data/2024/CVE-2024-12085-Otsutez_cve-2024-12085.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2024/CVE-2024-12085/README.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12085.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0e170467e8e76cab69d827be2a520352df55825c/doc/2025-01/%E3%80%90%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%80%9A%E5%91%8A%E3%80%91Rsync%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%EF%BC%88CVE-2024-12084%E2%88%95CVE-2024-12085%EF%BC%89.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-12085","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/r/rsync/rsync.spec","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/70a2e67cf4b780574379fe6685466348a1f2340b/2024/CVE-2024-12085.json","https://github.com/RsyncProject/rsync/blob/3b84610ccb35d1355f6e88e0e870bef48a164fbb/NEWS.md","https://github.com/Otsutez/cve-2024-12085"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0474.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0614","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0614.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57876","title":"Linux kernel DRM DP MST 竞态条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM DP MST（DisplayPort 多流传输）驱动中存在竞态条件漏洞。当 MST 拓扑在接收下行回复或上行请求边带消息过程中被移除时，`drm_dp_mst_topology_mgr` 的 `up_req_recv/down_rep_recv` 状态可能在一个线程中通过 `drm_dp_mst_set_mst(false)` 被重置，同时另一线程正在通过 `drm_dp_mst_handle_down_rep()` 或 `drm_dp_mst_handle_up_req()` 读取/解析消息，且读取/解析过程未持有锁保护接收状态，导致内存损坏。本地低权限攻击者可利用此竞态条件触发内存破坏，可能导致系统崩溃或权限提升。CVSS 评分 7.0，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57876"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07.930","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:07.567","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下修复版本：6.1.120、6.6.66、6.12.5 或更高版本。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户可通过 `apt update && apt install linux-image-$(uname -r | sed 's/.*/generic/')` 安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级内核，可在 BIOS/引导参数中禁用 DisplayPort MST 功能（添加 `drm.dp_mst=0` 到内核引导参数）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/94b33b2d7640e807869451384eb88321dd0ffbd4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6fa67d26de385c3c7a23c1e109a0e23bfda4ec7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/be826b4451fd187a7c0b04be4f8243d5df6e0450","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d834d20d2e86c52ed5cab41763fa61e6071680ef","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57876.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57876.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57876.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57876","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57876.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57876.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57876-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57876.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57876.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-3gjf-8gc5-3w3x/GHSA-3gjf-8gc5-3w3x.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0614.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0613","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0613.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57875","title":"Linux Linux内核块层常规区域位图使用后释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核块设备子系统中存在使用后释放（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当磁盘进行重验证（revalidation）操作更新 conventional zones 位图时，`disk_zone_is_conv()` 辅助函数在并发访问中可能引用已释放的内存，导致内核崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用分区块设备（zoned block devices）的 Linux 系统，本地攻击者需具备低权限访问，通过触发磁盘重验证操作即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57875"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07.803","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:07.467","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.8、6.11.11、6.6.73、6.1.125、5.15.176 或 5.10.232 及以上版本（含修复提交 493326c4f10c）。若无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用 SCSI 设备的区域重新验证功能（echo 0 > /sys/block/sdX/queue/zoned）作为临时缓解，或限制本地非特权用户对块设备的访问权限。建议优先通过发行版内核更新（如 Ubuntu USN-7381-1）部署修复内核包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/493326c4f10cc71a42c27fdc97ce112182ee4cbc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d7cb6d7414ea1b33536fa6d11805cb8dceec1f97","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57875.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57875.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2024-57875.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57875","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57875.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57875.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57875-block-rcu-protect-disk-conv-zones-b-1767883741000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57875.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-xr89-c9w4-g997/GHSA-xr89-c9w4-g997.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57875"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0613.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0612","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0612.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57874","title":"Linux Kernel arm64 ptrace 未初始化变量导致内核栈信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 arm64 架构的 ptrace 子系统中，`tagged_addr_ctrl_set()` 函数在处理 `NT_ARM_TAGGED_ADDR_CTRL` 寄存器集时未初始化临时变量 `ctrl`，当通过 `SETREGSET` 以零长度调用时，函数会使用栈上未初始化的值，导致最多 64 位内核栈内存信息泄露。该漏洞为本地漏洞，攻击者需具备低权限访问，通过构造特制的 ptrace 调用即可触发。由于 `set_tagged_addr_ctrl()` 仅接受 bits[63:4] 为零的值，泄露利用受限且写入机制不可用，但可能造成系统不稳定或敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57874"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07.680","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:07.273","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.13 及以上版本，或更新至以下已包含补丁的稳定版：5.10.231、5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.66、6.12.5。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新（如 Debian 用户参考 DLA-4075，Ubuntu 用户参考 USN-7381-1/USN-7450-1）。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 ptrace 系统调用或限制非特权用户对 SETREGSET 的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1152dd13845efde5554f80c7e1233bae1d26bd3e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1370cf3eb5495d70e00547598583a4cd45b40b99","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1c176f5155ee6161fee6f416b64aa50394d3f220","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/96035c0093db258975b8887676afe59a64c34a72","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/abd614bbfcee73247495bd9472da8f85ac83546e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ca62d90085f4af36de745883faab9f8a7cbb45d3","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57874.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57874.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57874","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57874.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57874.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57874.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57874-2025-11-03-1451","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57874.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-xvfj-8qrf-7mc3/GHSA-xvfj-8qrf-7mc3.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57874"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0612.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0611","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0611.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57872","title":"Linux Kernel SCSI UFS 平台驱动内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 UFS（通用闪存存储）驱动中的 ufshcd_pltfrm_remove() 函数在移除平台设备时未正确释放 HBA（主机总线适配器）结构体，导致 scsi_host_dev_release() 无法被正常调用，从而引发内存泄漏。本地攻击者可通过反复加载卸载 UFS 驱动模块触发该漏洞，长期运行后可能导致系统内存资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，需本地低权限访问，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57872"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07.560","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:07.130","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.5 或更高版本（包含提交 cd188519d246 和 897df60c16d5 的修复）。对于无法立即升级的系统，可应用补丁文件 drivers/ufs/host/ufshcd-pltfrm.c 中 ufshcd_pltfrm_remove() 函数的修复，确保在移除时调用 scsi_host_dev_release() 正确释放 HBA 内存。使用长期支持发行版（如 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS）的用户应安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/897df60c16d54ad515a3d0887edab5c63da06d1f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd188519d2467ab4c2141587b0551ba030abff0e","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57872.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57872.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57872","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2024-57872.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57872.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57872-scsi-ufs-pltfrm-dellocate-hba-durin-1767883840000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-6jqj-g976-vcvw/GHSA-6jqj-g976-vcvw.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57872","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/49fc6c5c0668d68233834d9d61b1c916248edd25/osv/AZL-55773.json","https://github.com/InfoSecREDD/CVE-Discord-Notify/blob/3f4b2b159624fda9a5cd9efcc2a46893068cd4db/seen_cves.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0611.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0608","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57850","title":"Linux kernel jffs2 rtime解压缩内存损坏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 JFFS2 文件系统的 rtime 解压缩例程在解压过程中未充分校验边界条件，当处理特制的损坏压缩数据时，会导致越界写入解压缩缓冲区之外的内存区域，造成内存损坏。本地攻击者可通过挂载恶意的 JFFS2 文件系统镜像触发此漏洞，可能导致系统崩溃或权限提升。该漏洞影响所有使用 JFFS2 文件系统的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57850"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07.423","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:06.410","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下安全版本：5.4.287、5.10.231、5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.66、6.12.5 或更高版本。对于 Debian 系统，安装 DLA-4075-1 安全更新；对于 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS，安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用 JFFS2 文件系统模块（`echo \"blacklist jffs2\" > /etc/modprobe.d/disable-jffs2.conf && update-initramfs -u`）并卸载已挂载的 JFFS2 分区作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/421f9e9f0fae9f8e721ffa07f22d9765fa1214d5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47c9a7f81027a78afea9d2e9a54bfd8fabb6b3d0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6808a1812a3419542223e7fe9e2de577e99e45d1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bd384b04ad1995441b18fe6c1366d02de8c5d5eb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dc39b08fcc3831b0bc46add91ba93cd2aab50716","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f6fc251baefc3cdc4f41f2f5a47940d7d4a67332","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fe051552f5078fa02d593847529a3884305a6ffe","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57850.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57850.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57850.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57850","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57850.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57850.md","https://github.com/openharmony/security/blob/f47b282130050082f1bcf6813aaced4157bd1771/vulntest/SSTSTestcases/2025/09/CVE-2024-57850/TestCaseRule-CVE-2024-57850.yara","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57850.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57850-2025-11-03-1451","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57850-jffs2-prevent-rtime-decompress-memo-1771405381000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0607","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0607.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57843","title":"Linux kernel virtio-net 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 virtio-net 驱动中的 virtnet_rq_alloc 函数存在整数溢出漏洞。当系统配置 net.core.high_order_alloc_disable 为 1 时，frag 分配始终仅获取一页内存，而 virtnet_rq_dma 结构体占用 16 字节位于 frag 头部，导致缓冲区与结构体总大小超过单页边界触发溢出。具有本地低权限的攻击者可利用此漏洞造成虚拟机崩溃或 SCP 大文件传输失败，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 virtio-net 的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57843"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07.170","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:06.020","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.66、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本（对应修复 commit a8f7d6963768/67a11de8965c/6aacd1484468）。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户更新至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可临时设置 sysctl net.core.high_order_alloc_disable=0 降低触发概率，但建议尽快重启加载新内核完成修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/67a11de8965c2ab19e215fb6651d44847e068614","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6aacd1484468361d1d04badfe75f264fa5314864","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a8f7d6963768b114ec9644ff0148dde4c104e84b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57843.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57843.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57843","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2024-57843.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57843.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57843.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57843.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-rvwg-gc58-2352/GHSA-rvwg-gc58-2352.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57843","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/49fc6c5c0668d68233834d9d61b1c916248edd25/osv/AZL-67779.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0607.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0604","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0604.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57809","title":"Linux 内核 NXP i.MX6QDL PCI 挂起恢复功能拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 i.MX6QDL 平台的 PCI imx6 驱动程序中存在挂起/恢复功能缺陷，在挂起后恢复时未能正确重置连接的 PCIe 设备，导致设备无法从 D3hot 状态切换回 D0 状态，触发内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过连接特定 PCIe 设备（如 ath10k 或 iwlwifi 无线网卡）并触发挂起/恢复操作，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 i.MX6QDL 处理器的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57809"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T14:15:25.080","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:04.797","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.4 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应提交为 ac43ea3d27a8 和 0a726f542d7c。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency` 安装 USN-7381-1 更新后重启。若无法立即升级，避免在 i.MX6QDL 设备上执行 suspend/resume 操作，或临时禁用 PCIe 设备作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a726f542d7c8cc0f9c5ed7df5a4bd4b59ac21b3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ac43ea3d27a8f9beadf3af66c9ea4a566ebfff1f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57809.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57809.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57809","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2024-57809.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57809.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57809.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57809-pci-imx6-fix-suspendresume-support--1767883598000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57809.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-m7r3-8cxw-w4p4/GHSA-m7r3-8cxw-w4p4.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57809"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0604.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0603","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0603.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57807","title":"Linux 内核 MegaRAID SAS 死锁漏洞","description":"Linux内核megaraid_sas驱动存在潜在死锁漏洞，源于reset_mutex与scan_mutex两个互斥锁存在循环锁依赖：CPU0持有reset_mutex等待scan_mutex，而CPU1持有scan_mutex等待reset_mutex，形成死锁导致系统挂起。该漏洞影响使用MegaRAID SAS控制器的Linux内核系统，CVSS 5.5（中危），攻击向量为本地，攻击复杂度低，需低权限，无需用户交互，可用性影响高。本地攻击者可通过触发并发SCSI操作（如设备重置与扫描同时进行）诱发相反顺序获取双锁，导致内核死锁拒绝服务。Linux内核已通过在获取scan_mutex前临时释放reset_mutex修复此死锁问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57807"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:30.790","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:04.617","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至包含修复的版本：Linux 6.12.5、6.11.11、6.6.63、6.1.120、5.15.179、5.10.234、5.4.291 或更高版本。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 提供的内核更新（linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 等），Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7459-1 更新，Debian 11 用户请应用 DLA-4075-1 更新。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时卸载 megaraid_sas 模块（modprobe -r megaraid_sas）或在启动参数中禁用该驱动（modprobe.blacklist=megaraid_sas）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3c654998a3e8167a58b6c6fede545fe400a4b554","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/466ca39dbf5d0ba71c16b15c27478a9c7d4022a8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/50740f4dc78b41dec7c8e39772619d5ba841ddd7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/78afb9bfad00c4aa58a424111d7edbcab9452f2b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/edadc693bfcc0f1ea08b8fa041c9361fd042410d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f36d024bd15ed356a80dda3ddc46d0a62aa55815","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f50783148ec98a1d38b87422e2ceaf2380b7b606","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57807.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57807.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57807.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57807","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57807.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57807.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57807.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57807-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-cr25-mcg8-cfvp/GHSA-cr25-mcg8-cfvp.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57807"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0603.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0602","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0602.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57804","title":"Linux内核 SCSI mpi3mr驱动 配置页面损坏漏洞","description":"Linux内核SCSI驱动程序mpi3mr存在一个配置页面破坏漏洞。驱动程序通过SAS传输暴露的sysfs接口，允许启用/禁用控制器/扩展器中的PHY。当多个PHY被快速启用/禁用时，会导致与SAS IO单元/SAS扩展器相关的持久和当前配置页面遭到破坏。攻击者通过sysfs接口需要本地访问权限，触发PHY状态的快速切换操作，从而引发配置页面损坏。该漏洞影响Linux内核版本，CVSS评分5.5（中等严重性）。尽管目前没有报告出具体的利用实例或直接影响，但配置页面的破坏可能导致系统不稳定，并可能为进一步攻击提供机会。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57804"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:30.233","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:04.303","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至已修复版本：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 请安装 USN-7381-1 提供的内核更新（linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 及以上）；Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 请安装 USN-7514-1 提供的内核更新。其他发行版请升级至 Linux 6.12.2、6.11.11、6.6.66、6.1.117 或 5.15.176 及以上版本。若暂无法升级内核，可通过 `echo 0 > /sys/class/scsi_host/hostX/device/phy_enable` 禁用受影响控制器的 PHY 切换功能作为临时缓解，但会失去 PHY 启用/禁用功能。建议优先通过发行版包管理器（如 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-generic`）应用官方内核更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/711201a8b8334a397440ac0b859df0054e174bc9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/869fdc6f0606060301aef648231e186c7c542f5a","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57804.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57804.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57804.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57804","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57804.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57804.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57804.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57804.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57804-scsi-mpi3mr-fix-corrupt-config-page-1767883799000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-q94p-cf39-j6hv/GHSA-q94p-cf39-j6hv.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0602.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0599","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0599.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57798","title":"Linux Linux Kernel DRM DP MST 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM DP MST 子系统的 `drm_dp_mst_handle_up_req()` 函数中存在空指针解引用与释放后使用漏洞。当一个线程处理 MST 上行请求消息时，另一线程可能通过 `drm_dp_mst_topology_mgr_set_mst(false)` 移除 MST 拓扑结构，释放 `mst_primary` 指针并置为 NULL，导致并发访问时出现空指针解引用或释放后使用，可能造成本地权限提升或系统崩溃。攻击者需具备本地低权限即可利用，影响使用 Linux 内核的各类系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57798"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:29.743","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:03.557","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至至少 6.1.82 版本或以上；如果使用 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS，请执行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-generic-hwe-22.04` 进行内核升级；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 执行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-generic-hwe-24.04`。如无法立即升级，可通过在内核启动参数中添加 `drm_dp_mst_topology_mgr_set_mst=0` 禁用 MST 功能作为临时缓解措施（需重新启动生效），但会导致多显示器 MST 链路不可用，适用于低风险环境。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9735d40f5fde9970aa46e828ecc85c32571d58a2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ce55818b2d3a999f886af91679589e4644ff1dc8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e54b00086f7473dbda1a7d6fc47720ced157c6a8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f61b2e5e7821f868d6afc22382a66a30ee780ba0","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57798.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57798.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57798.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57798","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57798.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57798.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57798-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57798.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57798-drmdp-mst-ensure-mst-primary-pointe-1771412343000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-9x94-vh8x-vrhp/GHSA-9x94-vh8x-vrhp.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0599.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0564","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0564.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56369","title":"Linux kernel DRM modesetting 除零错误漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM 子系统的 drm_mode_vrefresh() 函数在计算显示器刷新率时存在除零漏洞。该函数虽已检查 htotal 和 vtotal 是否为 0，但未充分处理 vtotal 与 htotal 乘积后仍可能出现的除零异常，导致内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过设置特定的显示模式参数触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56369"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:28.700","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:07.457","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.15.176、6.1.122、6.6.68、6.12.7 或 6.13 及以上。各发行版用户可通过包管理器更新：Ubuntu 运行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image` 并重启；Debian 参考 DLA-4041-1 公告更新内核。如无法立即升级，可通过 seccomp 或 AppArmor 限制本地用户加载自定义显示模式作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47c8b6cf1d08f0ad40d7ea7b025442e51b35ee1f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/69fbb01e891701e6d04db1ddb5ad49e42c4dd963","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9398332f23fab10c5ec57c168b44e72997d6318e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b39de5a71bac5641d0fda33d1cf5682d82cf1ae5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e7c7b48a0fc5ed83baae400a1b15e33978c25d7f","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56369.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56369.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56369.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56369","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56369.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56369-2025-11-03-1435","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56369.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56369.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56369","https://github.com/openharmony/docs/blob/f41b9345badd47c7ab0c263344cd7f4b5a549afb/en/release-notes/OpenHarmony-v4.1.3-release.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0564.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0562","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0562.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-55916","title":"Linux Kernel Hyper-V 工具驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Hyper-V 驱动工具（hv_util）中的 KVP（键值对）和 VSS（卷影副本）组件存在条件竞争漏洞。当 KVP 或 VSS 守护进程在 VMBus 通道的环形缓冲区完全初始化之前启动时，守护进程通过字符设备注册自身会触发尚未就绪的回调函数，导致空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃（panic）。本地攻击者可在具备低权限条件下，通过控制 KVP/VSS 守护进程的启动时机触发该条件竞争，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。官方修复方案为调整 util_probe() 中的初始化顺序，确保在 vmbus_open() 完成环形缓冲区初始化后再创建字符设备入口。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-55916"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:28.353","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:26.560","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.289、5.10.233、5.15.176、6.1.122、6.6.68、6.12.7 或更高版本。对应各发行版，Debian 11/12 用户安装 linux 6.1.122-1 及以上版本，Ubuntu 24.04 用户安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可卸载 hv_utils 内核模块（rmmod hv_utils）并阻止 KVP/VSS 守护进程自启动，避免竞争条件触发内核空指针解引用崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/042253c57be901bfd19f15b68267442b70f510d5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/07a756a49f4b4290b49ea46e089cbe6f79ff8d26","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3dd7a30c6d7f90afcf19e9b072f572ba524d7ec6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/718fe694a334be9d1a89eed22602369ac18d6583","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/89fcec5e466b3ac9b376e0d621c71effa1a